          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Summary: Discontinuous observation of a white rectangular PAN with a zigzag trajectory: probable observation of aircraft (a Dash Milan 80 aircraft on a surveillance mission for fire risk over the Toulon mountains (phases 1b and 3), and regular flight of a commercial aircraft (for phase 2)).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "efd543d7106ea0867e339bd097c223807782819a0d41733b385aa6e92c05c8e6"
        },
